"Flexible Timers is operated by Xintech LLC. Flexible Timers may send SMS\n      messages only to a phone number that a signed-in user adds, verifies, and\n      opts into as their own account phone number. The current SMS program is\n      limited to account phone verification codes and user-created timer/reminder\n      SMS that the user schedules for themselves. Flexible Timers does not send\n      marketing text messages and does not allow users to send SMS to arbitrary\n      third-party recipients. Flexible Timers SMS is not a two-way chat or\n      conversation service; inbound keywords are used only for STOP, HELP, START,\n      and YES compliance handling." = "Flexible Timers drives af Xintech LLC. Flexible Timers kan kun sende\n      SMS-beskeder til et telefonnummer, som en indlogget bruger tilføjer,\n      bekræfter og tilmelder som sit eget kontotelefonnummer. Det nuværende\n      SMS-program er begrænset til bekræftelseskoder for kontotelefonnummeret og\n      brugeroprettede timer- eller påmindelses-SMS'er, som brugeren planlægger\n      for sig selv. Flexible Timers sender ikke marketingbeskeder og tillader\n      ikke brugere at sende SMS til vilkårlige tredjepartsmodtagere. Flexible\n      Timers SMS er ikke en tovejschat eller samtaletjeneste; indgående søgeord\n      bruges kun til overholdelse for STOP, HELP, START og YES.";
"Flexible Timers reminder: You scheduled this SMS reminder for 4:00 PM:\n      Pick up child for after-school piano class. Reply STOP to opt out, HELP\n      for help." = "Flexible Timers-påmindelse: Du har planlagt denne SMS-påmindelse til kl. 16:00:\n      Hent barn til klavertime efter skole. Svar STOP for at fravælge,\n      HELP for at få hjælp.";
"Flexible Timers verification code: 123456. This code expires in 10\n      minutes. Reply STOP to opt out, HELP for help." = "Flexible Timers-bekræftelseskode: 123456. Denne kode udløber om 10\n      minutter. Svar STOP for at fravælge og HELP for at få hjælp.";
